WEBVTT

00:16.260 --> 00:23.100
Presented By Refrain Subs!

00:26.770 --> 00:32.650
Since being alone was tough, the two of us held hands.

00:33.150 --> 00:39.160
The two of us were lonely, so we all stood in a circle and joined hands.

00:39.120 --> 00:47.370
I'm sure that's where we will gather our strength.

00:47.290 --> 00:52.340
Enough to stand up to any dream.

00:52.210 --> 00:54.970
Fly high towards the sky,

00:54.630 --> 00:59.140
Kick off the ground and send your voice to the heavens,

00:58.840 --> 01:04.180
Until you overcome those painful days.

01:03.970 --> 01:09.310
I'll never forget your voice, and I'll never forget your tears.

01:05.930 --> 01:05.980
The First Annual Make Kyousuke Chuckle Championships

01:08.940 --> 01:16.280
The future that we call "hope" begins now.

01:16.030 --> 01:27.080
Your feet will continue to step onward, even when the time of grief comes.

01:36.940 --> 01:39.470
Yeah, it's a great day for a catnap.

01:39.470 --> 01:43.350
It's the perfect weather to read under the shade

01:46.900 --> 01:48.240
Let's go play!

01:48.240 --> 01:49.730
I want to play too!

01:49.730 --> 01:52.190
Well, what should we do?

01:52.190 --> 01:56.440
That's what we're gonna think about now!

01:57.780 --> 01:59.960
Huh, Kyousuke went job hunting?

01:59.960 --> 02:01.930
He wasn't even here this morning.

02:02.660 --> 02:03.880
Now that you mention it...

02:07.000 --> 02:08.140
It's a cat.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.250
Rin.

02:14.340 --> 02:15.660
Is this one of yours?

02:15.660 --> 02:17.540
No, I've never seen it before.

02:17.780 --> 02:19.050
Hold still.

02:21.260 --> 02:22.280
Hey, wait up!

02:25.640 --> 02:26.710
Which way did it go?

02:29.480 --> 02:31.850
Come on, please stop.

02:31.850 --> 02:33.400
Coming all the way out here...

02:33.400 --> 02:34.770
I don't have any food, you know.

02:34.770 --> 02:36.600
Sasasegawa Sasami!

02:36.600 --> 02:39.660
Would that happen to be your cat, Sasasegawa-san?

02:40.180 --> 02:41.430
You're mistaken!

02:41.430 --> 02:43.130
What's going on?

02:43.130 --> 02:44.850
It seems to like you, though.

02:46.930 --> 02:48.750
I told you, you're mistaken!

02:48.750 --> 02:49.920
To begin with...

02:50.690 --> 02:53.100
I don't like cats.

02:54.900 --> 02:55.750
Sa-chan...

02:56.850 --> 02:58.000
Kamikita-san...!

03:00.530 --> 03:01.710
"Sa-chan?"

03:05.720 --> 03:08.380
Natsume Rin, I'll remember this!

03:09.110 --> 03:12.510
I always wonder <i>what</i> she'll remember...

03:17.330 --> 03:20.140
Isn't it great that you get along with Sasasegawa-san so well?

03:20.140 --> 03:25.070
Sorry for keeping it a secret, but Sa-chan is quite shy.

03:25.070 --> 03:27.370
She didn't want me to tell anyone.

03:27.370 --> 03:29.260
You guys took care of it together?

03:29.750 --> 03:32.870
The cat was really weak when we first found it.

03:32.870 --> 03:34.710
Sa-chan was the one who found it.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.780
Your food is over here.

03:43.750 --> 03:46.070
Maybe it's not hungry?

03:46.070 --> 03:47.320
He...

03:47.320 --> 03:48.220
What is it?

03:48.220 --> 03:51.830
Well, he kind of looked a little sad about something.

04:14.600 --> 04:16.220
Oh, you're finally awake.

04:18.970 --> 04:21.670
You look like you had a good sleep.

04:21.670 --> 04:24.600
Did you see a beautiful dream about muscles?

04:32.020 --> 04:33.420
It was a lonely dream.

04:34.290 --> 04:37.080
Someone who was left behind was crying.

04:37.940 --> 04:39.690
Was it from my memory?

04:40.060 --> 04:40.970
No...

04:45.970 --> 04:47.660
What? What is it?

04:49.330 --> 04:50.560
What's wrong?

04:50.560 --> 04:51.740
Are you hungry?

04:55.210 --> 04:56.690
I can't understand...

04:59.500 --> 05:00.540
I'm sorry.

05:03.080 --> 05:05.060
Come on, don't follow me!

05:09.060 --> 05:10.940
What's up with that cat?

05:13.770 --> 05:15.630
So it took a liking to you, huh?

05:15.630 --> 05:18.060
I don't think that's the right way to put it...

05:18.060 --> 05:21.250
You better deal with it before the dorm leader finds out.

05:26.020 --> 05:27.280
Did you want to go in there?

05:31.810 --> 05:33.330
What's up with the cat?

05:35.620 --> 05:37.290
It just followed me...

05:44.630 --> 05:46.180
Oh look, it's a female!

05:49.410 --> 05:50.590
It just swiped me!

05:53.160 --> 05:54.600
Come on in.

05:54.760 --> 05:56.340
Here, let me take a look.

05:56.340 --> 05:58.300
You're so pushy.

06:01.830 --> 06:03.670
What were you two doing?

06:03.670 --> 06:05.770
Riki forcibly grabbed me.

06:06.040 --> 06:08.070
Come on, don't be like that.

06:08.070 --> 06:10.990
Naoe-san forced himself onto Inohara-san.

06:11.560 --> 06:14.090
That should be considered a crime indeed.

06:14.330 --> 06:18.620
No, I was just checking to see if his eye was scratched.

06:22.170 --> 06:25.350
Will I become <i>mega</i> muscular if I drink this?

06:25.350 --> 06:28.620
Yeah, we'll both become <i>giga</i> muscular!

06:30.020 --> 06:31.780
Kud wanted to read this?

06:31.780 --> 06:36.310
Yes, I'm sorry we didn't tell you we were coming beforehand...

06:36.310 --> 06:38.470
Don't worry about it, I was just about to...

06:38.470 --> 06:40.440
Do you guys want to drink some too?

06:40.440 --> 06:44.310
It's called "Masato's Special Muscle Drink Mk. 2"

06:44.310 --> 06:47.750
It even has the wonderful scent of katsudon.

06:47.750 --> 06:49.560
I'll pass.

06:49.560 --> 06:52.630
It'd be a problem if my body didn't revert back.

06:52.630 --> 06:53.410
Is that so...?

06:53.410 --> 06:56.060
All right, Let's hurry up and try this!

06:56.060 --> 06:57.240
Let's do it!

07:04.130 --> 07:05.590
That cat...

07:07.660 --> 07:08.300
Nothing.

07:08.300 --> 07:10.070
It must be my imagination.

07:17.450 --> 07:19.120
Wake up.

07:22.320 --> 07:24.690
I'm telling you to wake up!

07:24.690 --> 07:26.080
Who is it?

07:27.610 --> 07:29.210
Oh, it's Sasasegawa-san...

07:30.710 --> 07:31.640
Why?!

07:32.150 --> 07:33.660
You're being too loud.

07:33.660 --> 07:34.980
I mean...

07:35.640 --> 07:37.380
Oh, this must be a dream—

07:37.830 --> 07:40.310
This is reality.

07:40.310 --> 07:42.980
Why won't you open your eyes already?

07:45.500 --> 07:46.630
Is someone there?

08:04.710 --> 08:06.190
Sasasegawa-san has...

08:06.530 --> 08:08.060
turned into a cat?

08:08.340 --> 08:11.780
What's going on? Did your muscles suddenly get huge or something?

08:14.390 --> 08:15.940
Oh, it's just the cat.

08:15.940 --> 08:17.680
It's Sasasegawa-san.

08:18.570 --> 08:21.210
This cat is Sasasegawa-san.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.160
I'm getting a stomachache.

08:28.160 --> 08:30.170
Why have you turned into a cat?

08:30.170 --> 08:31.910
Can you not change back?

08:31.910 --> 08:33.840
You changed back earlier, right?

08:37.290 --> 08:42.310
But even if you say it's her, I've never seen Sasasegawa like this before.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.780
Up you go.

08:56.520 --> 08:58.160
How dare you treat me this way?!

08:58.160 --> 08:59.330
Not to mention, twice?!

08:59.340 --> 09:01.010
I have never been humiliated like this in my—

09:01.450 --> 09:02.720
You changed back!

09:04.460 --> 09:06.000
Indeed I have.

09:06.360 --> 09:07.870
What's going on?

09:07.870 --> 09:09.880
That's what <i>I </i>would like to know!

09:11.030 --> 09:14.030
Well then, I'll be heading back.

09:14.310 --> 09:16.760
You're not worried about turning back into a cat?

09:16.760 --> 09:19.530
My roommate must be worried sick about me.

09:19.530 --> 09:23.760
Not to mention, I should not be out at a boy's room this late.

09:23.760 --> 09:26.020
You shouldn't be worrying about that right now.

09:26.020 --> 09:28.270
This is an extremely important matter!

09:28.610 --> 09:29.480
But...

09:29.480 --> 09:32.300
You're quite meddlesome, aren't you?

09:32.830 --> 09:34.570
But I appreciate your concern.

09:35.060 --> 09:36.730
Thank you.

09:38.320 --> 09:40.110
Well then, have a good evening.

09:44.260 --> 09:45.620
Sasasegawa-san!

09:45.940 --> 09:47.560
It happened again?

09:47.560 --> 09:49.490
I told you this would happen.

09:49.490 --> 09:50.950
I had no choice.

09:50.950 --> 09:53.120
If I stayed here in my regular form...

09:54.470 --> 09:55.380
What is it?

09:55.800 --> 09:58.000
I can understand what you're saying.

10:00.420 --> 10:03.890
Let's put aside the fact that I can communicate with you.

10:03.890 --> 10:05.110
Why—

10:05.110 --> 10:07.850
Why am I turning into a cat?

10:08.260 --> 10:11.680
Kyousuke isn't here right now, so I need to deal with this.

10:12.430 --> 10:14.190
Mission start!

10:14.570 --> 10:18.170
Sasasegawa-san, let's go over the current situation.

10:18.890 --> 10:19.750
Huh?

10:19.750 --> 10:23.030
For example, you turned into a cat when

10:23.360 --> 10:26.540
Masato woke up and when you stepped out of the veranda.

10:27.290 --> 10:31.540
You turned back to normal when Masato fainted and...

10:31.540 --> 10:34.880
So this filthy musclehead is the source of our problem.

10:34.880 --> 10:37.890
Let's not jump to conclusions.

10:37.890 --> 10:39.010
Besides,

10:39.010 --> 10:42.200
I'm fairly certain I've got this figured out.

10:42.200 --> 10:45.260
You become a cat when you leave this room.

10:46.100 --> 10:49.520
You turned back to normal when you entered the room through the veranda.

10:49.520 --> 10:50.640
Which means...

10:50.640 --> 10:53.680
Are you implying I cannot leave this room?

10:53.680 --> 10:56.980
That I must remain here until we resolve this issue?

10:56.980 --> 10:58.960
N-No I didn't quite mean that...

10:58.960 --> 11:00.300
That is what you just said!

11:00.300 --> 11:05.770
Why do I have to share a room with someone in this filthy boy's dorm?

11:07.130 --> 11:08.940
Be quiet, will ya...

11:12.410 --> 11:15.680
We were in the middle of a conversation.

11:17.090 --> 11:19.590
Get out of here you musclehead!

11:23.890 --> 11:27.200
Sorry, there's nothing I can do about it.

11:27.960 --> 11:29.560
Between muscles and the black cat,

11:29.560 --> 11:32.320
you chose the black cat,
that's all there is to it.

11:32.320 --> 11:36.600
Muscles have no choice but to rely on and fend for themselves.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.440
Cheer up, Masato.

11:38.440 --> 11:42.070
That's right, you've got tons of muscles, don't you?

11:42.070 --> 11:44.360
Let's both smile and laugh with those wonderful muscles again!

11:44.360 --> 11:47.530
Will you... Will you play with this musclehead again?

11:47.530 --> 11:48.810
Of course!

11:48.810 --> 11:51.550
Come on, "Muscles, Muscles!"

11:52.990 --> 11:54.770
Then it can't be helped, I'll be gone for a bit.

11:54.770 --> 11:56.520
A farewell muscles-shake.

11:56.520 --> 11:59.180
Of course, let's muscle again some day.

12:00.410 --> 12:02.450
You really are the best!

12:03.310 --> 12:05.820
Riki is the best! Muscles are the best!

12:05.820 --> 12:08.720
No way, Masato is the best!

12:07.990 --> 12:09.350
They are imbeciles, are they not?

12:11.390 --> 12:13.680
Masato's bunk is free...

12:13.680 --> 12:16.380
I refuse!

12:16.380 --> 12:19.110
Anyway, pass me your cellphone.

12:19.110 --> 12:22.150
I wish to contact my roommate.

12:26.710 --> 12:28.360
Hello?

12:31.120 --> 12:32.950
This again?

12:32.950 --> 12:34.350
Riki-kun.

12:34.350 --> 12:35.770
What is it?

12:35.770 --> 12:37.830
Kamikita-san, it is I.

12:37.830 --> 12:39.340
Nyaa?

12:41.180 --> 12:42.810
Nya, Nyaa?

12:42.810 --> 12:43.910
Komari-san?

12:43.910 --> 12:45.180
Oh, Riki-kun.

12:45.180 --> 12:46.720
Was that the cat?

12:46.720 --> 12:48.390
Just as I thought, she can't understand her.

12:49.640 --> 12:53.830
Sasasegawa-san can't make it to the phone, but she won't be able to return tonight.

12:54.470 --> 12:55.700
Why's that?

12:55.700 --> 12:58.060
She's in a bit of a complicated situation.

12:58.060 --> 12:59.690
Did something happen to her?

12:59.690 --> 13:01.700
She's not sick, is she?

13:01.700 --> 13:03.530
It's fine, no need to worry about it.

13:03.530 --> 13:05.370
All right then, I got it.

13:05.370 --> 13:07.140
Will you be with her?

13:07.140 --> 13:10.940
Yeah, she might have to stay at the boy's dorm for tonight.

13:10.940 --> 13:12.910
Oh, is that so...

13:14.720 --> 13:18.420
S-So Sa-chan and Riki-kun are having a midnight rendezvous?!

13:20.290 --> 13:21.750
Pass me the phone.

13:24.740 --> 13:27.680
Stop complaining, go bathe, and head straight to bed!

13:29.750 --> 13:33.180
All I'm hearing is "Nyaa", but I'm sorry!

13:36.260 --> 13:38.710
Is this okay for a change of clothes?

13:38.710 --> 13:41.150
That will do, thank you so much.

13:41.150 --> 13:44.030
It's like we're living together.

13:44.030 --> 13:45.200
Living together?

13:45.200 --> 13:47.430
I didn't mean to imply anything.

13:47.430 --> 13:49.420
On second thought, I do not need it.

13:49.420 --> 13:50.240
Are you sure that's okay?

13:50.650 --> 13:52.760
It is fine like this.

13:52.760 --> 13:53.830
But...

13:53.830 --> 13:55.580
I told you it is fine!

13:56.420 --> 13:57.840
Good night.

14:00.980 --> 14:02.590
This is so pitiful.

14:04.490 --> 14:08.160
I wonder why she doesn't transform in front of me...

14:08.160 --> 14:09.880
I can even understand her as a cat.

14:10.820 --> 14:13.580
Why is it only me?

14:18.850 --> 14:22.110
For the time being, I'll look for someone who could help.

14:22.110 --> 14:23.970
I'm counting on you.

14:23.970 --> 14:25.930
All right, I'll see you later.

14:25.930 --> 14:26.890
Wait.

14:28.110 --> 14:29.360
Your hair.

14:29.360 --> 14:30.890
It's messy.

14:43.240 --> 14:45.240
It's much better now.

14:45.240 --> 14:46.420
Thank you.

14:46.420 --> 14:49.630
It irritates me when people don't look proper!

14:49.630 --> 14:51.610
Then, have a good day.

14:51.610 --> 14:53.430
Yeah, I'm off.

15:00.050 --> 15:01.300
Good morning.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.560
Oh, good morning.

15:03.510 --> 15:04.900
Hey, I can't see.

15:04.900 --> 15:08.080
If it's about cats, it has to be Rin.

15:08.080 --> 15:10.600
Rin, are you free during lunch?

15:16.160 --> 15:18.150
Here, Mon Petit.

15:19.620 --> 15:24.220
Natsume Rin, just how much do you intend to humiliate me?

15:24.220 --> 15:26.170
Do you want me to pat your chin?

15:26.970 --> 15:29.380
Would you please keep your hands off me?!

15:29.380 --> 15:30.520
Calm down...

15:30.520 --> 15:32.950
Guess there's nothing I can do, I'm heading back.

15:32.950 --> 15:34.050
Really?

15:35.710 --> 15:38.930
With these types, you just have to train them bit by bit.

15:43.340 --> 15:46.600
Looks like she can't understand what you're saying.

15:46.600 --> 15:49.900
I do not want her to help me anyway.

15:49.900 --> 15:52.780
That aside, what is the meaning of this?!

15:52.780 --> 15:55.380
Well, I thought you would like it, being a cat and all.

15:55.380 --> 15:57.610
So it was your idea...

15:57.610 --> 16:01.450
Go the the cafeteria and get me a sandwich and some tea already!

16:07.920 --> 16:09.670
Is it not tasty?

16:09.670 --> 16:10.890
That's not it.

16:10.890 --> 16:15.010
Just thinking about how I'm living my life like a complete shut-in...

16:15.830 --> 16:17.640
I feel more and more miserable.

16:17.640 --> 16:20.690
Come on, cheer up.

16:20.690 --> 16:24.610
I mean, you're pretty amazing, Sasasegawa-san.

16:24.850 --> 16:29.920
It's really impressive of you to have become a regular on the softball team in your first year.

16:29.920 --> 16:33.330
Not to mention, you're also adored by your underclassmen.

16:33.330 --> 16:37.300
That's right, I'm the hope of the softball team.

16:37.910 --> 16:40.800
I have braved the hardships, endured the frustrations.

16:40.800 --> 16:44.410
I went so far to steel myself for this.

16:49.460 --> 16:54.420
To be crushed by something like this, how low hast the mighty fallen.

16:55.160 --> 16:57.390
Now she's back to treating me like a monkey.

17:00.200 --> 17:03.480
At this point, it doesn't matter whether I'm a cat or not!

17:03.480 --> 17:08.410
Naoe Riki, let us go find somebody who can understand me.

17:12.150 --> 17:14.300
Hello there, kitty.

17:14.940 --> 17:16.070
Hello.

17:16.070 --> 17:17.780
She responded to me.

17:17.780 --> 17:20.460
What a clever little kitten.

17:23.290 --> 17:28.000
What's this? You look like you want to be petted.

17:30.840 --> 17:32.460
Would you please keep your hands off me?!

17:36.020 --> 17:39.590
You guys, it's me, Sasasegawa.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.040
It appears we have struggled in vain...

17:49.040 --> 17:50.400
Yeah...

17:52.180 --> 17:54.150
Riki-kun!

17:54.150 --> 17:55.500
Komari-san.

17:56.420 --> 17:58.370
Oh, the kitty is here too.

18:00.470 --> 18:02.580
Come on, stop it, Kamikita-san.

18:02.580 --> 18:04.580
Sa-chan still can't return yet?

18:05.930 --> 18:08.710
You told me not to worry, but...

18:08.710 --> 18:11.330
I can't help but worry, after all.

18:15.390 --> 18:16.210
Komari-san.

18:16.920 --> 18:20.100
I need you to listen carefully to what I'm about to tell you.

18:23.310 --> 18:24.770
Japanese Dictionary

18:23.330 --> 18:24.790
Foundations of
Classic Grammar

18:23.330 --> 18:24.790
Basic Drill Series

