18:23.330 --> 18:24.790
Short Essay Phrases

18:24.150 --> 18:25.830
You're Sa-chan?

18:25.830 --> 18:28.430
That is right! It is I!

18:30.780 --> 18:32.040
Answer this, then!

18:32.040 --> 18:35.070
Sa-chan always buys this certain drink.

18:35.070 --> 18:41.130
You can only get it at the vending machine in front of the station, so how many does she buy at once?

18:45.040 --> 18:47.790
That's right, so it <i>is</i> Sa-chan.

18:48.050 --> 18:49.770
Kamikita-san.

18:49.770 --> 18:53.300
Right now, I am touched by our deep friendship.

18:53.300 --> 18:54.970
What did she say?

18:54.970 --> 18:57.560
She says she's touched by your deep friendship.

18:58.550 --> 19:04.440
Don't worry, I'll be your friend no matter what, Sa-chan.

19:07.430 --> 19:09.480
I'll leave Sa-chan in your care.

19:09.480 --> 19:12.510
I'll also do whatever I can to help.

19:12.510 --> 19:14.550
Yeah, thank you.

19:14.550 --> 19:16.650
No problem.

19:18.470 --> 19:19.740
See you tomorrow.

19:25.220 --> 19:27.700
Kud sure is spinning a lot today, as well!

19:31.160 --> 19:33.870
Did Komari-chan oversleep?

19:33.870 --> 19:37.000
Well, there's still some time left before classes begin.

19:45.100 --> 19:47.850
I wonder if Komari-san is taking a day off.

19:49.990 --> 19:51.560
I've brought you lunch.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.310
S-Sorry!

19:55.890 --> 19:58.310
Please knock before you enter!

19:59.050 --> 20:02.980
Sa-chan,
I've brought you  a change of clothes.
After all, we’re friends.

19:59.050 --> 20:02.980
From Komari

19:59.490 --> 20:01.580
Where did you get that change of clothes?

20:01.580 --> 20:02.990
From Kamikita-san.

20:02.990 --> 20:07.290
Seems like she brought it here in the short time I was out.

20:02.990 --> 20:03.030
Sa-chan,
I've brought you a change of clothes.
After all, we're friends.

20:06.280 --> 20:06.320
From Komari

20:07.290 --> 20:09.120
Komari-san came by?

20:09.120 --> 20:11.620
Oh, so you went out on your own?

20:12.040 --> 20:15.740
There are many things you can only do by going out.

20:15.740 --> 20:17.480
Like going to the bathroom.

20:17.480 --> 20:18.450
Come in.

20:20.170 --> 20:21.800
She's really mindful of others.

20:21.800 --> 20:25.010
Getting a change of clothes by myself would have been difficult.

20:25.890 --> 20:30.130
Now that I think about it, when you change back from a cat, you've always got your clothes on, right?

20:31.360 --> 20:32.930
Is that a problem?

20:33.440 --> 20:38.680
For example, in a movie there are drugs that turn you into a mutant, right?

20:38.680 --> 20:43.030
So like, if you transform and get huge, your clothes tear, right?

20:43.030 --> 20:44.820
So why don't yours do that?

20:45.380 --> 20:46.820
You want to take them off?

20:46.820 --> 20:49.790
No, that's not it.

20:49.790 --> 20:54.740
Normally, it'd be weird if your clothes transformed along with your body, right?

20:54.740 --> 20:56.420
I guess...

20:56.420 --> 20:57.500
You are right...

20:57.500 --> 21:00.310
Yeah, it's unrealistic.

21:00.310 --> 21:03.730
That's why, this probably isn't reality.

21:04.300 --> 21:06.090
Just like that time...

21:06.940 --> 21:11.090
This is a world where, even if that were to happen, it wouldn't be strange.

21:11.090 --> 21:12.070
What are you talking about—

21:12.070 --> 21:14.930
I mean, don't you feel like something was off from the beginning?

21:14.930 --> 21:17.170
There's no way you'd turn into a cat.

21:17.170 --> 21:21.200
So what's weird is this kind of world where this is possible.

21:21.980 --> 21:27.520
So you're saying we've wandered into a strange world?

21:27.520 --> 21:28.530
Yeah.

21:30.040 --> 21:32.440
Have you been reading too many manga?

21:32.440 --> 21:34.330
There is no way that could happen.

21:36.080 --> 21:37.410
I can't find Komari-chan.

21:38.210 --> 21:39.540
Komari-chan...

21:40.340 --> 21:41.880
is gone...

21:45.360 --> 21:52.090
Episode 5

21:45.360 --> 21:52.090
Sasami Turns Into A Cat

21:52.050 --> 21:55.220
While I ran around the bases,

21:55.520 --> 21:58.850
I suddenly stopped in my tracks

21:58.940 --> 22:05.730
To gaze at the ball that flew above my head.

22:05.820 --> 22:09.030
I wondered why

22:09.200 --> 22:12.450
I couldn’t even get that one hit,

22:12.660 --> 22:19.000
As I stood there bewildered.

22:19.290 --> 22:25.960
One point away, yet it feels so far.

22:21.040 --> 22:24.250
To the delicate eye.

22:26.130 --> 22:29.300
Don’t you feel that way too?

22:27.840 --> 22:31.260
Even if you feel like that.

22:29.630 --> 22:38.640
I wonder if I’ll be able to stand up to bat.

22:39.640 --> 22:42.480
But I know

22:42.520 --> 22:46.570
that my story from now on

22:46.610 --> 22:53.990
Is a journey for me to become as strong as you.

22:55.910 --> 23:00.620
This scene, where various ripples, forming and expanding,

23:00.250 --> 23:03.880
Are overlapping...

23:03.500 --> 23:10.630
You must not forget, these are everyone's feelings.

23:13.340 --> 23:17.140
As I look at you sitting next to me now

23:16.930 --> 23:26.110
You seem to be a little more mature.

23:30.920 --> 23:40.900
Episode 6

23:30.920 --> 23:40.900
A Small World Someone Wished For

23:32.000 --> 23:34.580
Who's behind all this?

23:34.580 --> 23:36.310
Well basically, Zazaza—

23:36.310 --> 23:40.230
Wait a moment, I just remembered something from my past.
